
Current History

	1993 - The government contracted space experiments and exploration
               to several different companies, and erased NASA.

        1994 - Space exploration was rampant, the contracted companies
               were making multi-billions on new discoveries and precious
               ores.  All world-wide  governments can not control the Space
               companies great expansion, and begin to detiorate.

        2000 - Company takeovers on earth resulted in earth governments
               starting a nuclear holocaust.   Cities were devestated and
               most governments were totally destroyed.
               
        2004 - After existing for nearly 11 years, companies take over all 
               rule on earth.  Governments cease to exist, the companies
               control all law enforcement (which is close to none). 
               To gain control of the planet, each company started hiring
               assassins to destroy the prosperity of their competition!

        NOW  - You are employed by a company looking for blood and money.  
               You are assigned missions to track and kill anyone who gets 
               in your way. Assassinators are battling for total control 
               of the planet - for themselves or for thier employer.

